      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Great clash between two of Queensland's best four-year-olds. FINAL DEADLINE NZ (4) returns after winning four of five outings last campaign including the Redcliffe Gold Cup and the 4YO Championship at this circuit and distance when last seen in July. Has a strong fresh record and will be ready to go off a trial win. FATE AWAITS (5) was just a head behind Final Deadline when they last clashed in the 4YO Championship and has easily won his two outings since. Has the race fitness edge on the top pick and his strike rate at this circuit and distance is strong. EXCLUSIVE HUSTLER (2) may struggle to match the top two but he has put three placings together and draws well. BIRKIRKARA (9) next best.",
